{"id":"n55809-5-4","stage":4,"title":"메마르다 · 干燥","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55809-5-4-1","ko":"차고 메마른 바람이 분다.","zh":"风刮得干冷刺骨。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"차고","meaning":"冷，寒冷，凉，冰凉","explanation":"차다：冷，寒冷，凉，冰凉；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"차다","audio":"/audio/d8eb940a7794fc46db6b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37235","senseId":"1","lemma":"차다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"메마른","meaning":"干燥","explanation":"메마르다：干燥；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"메마르다","audio":"/audio/242a13186f116c2ffb71.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55809","senseId":"5","lemma":"메마르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바람이","meaning":"风","explanation":"바람：风；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"바람","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85627","senseId":"1","lemma":"바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"분다.","meaning":"刮，吹","explanation":"불다：刮，吹；ㄴ다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"불다","audio":"/audio/1389fa35feb8849f522f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74179","senseId":"1","lemma":"불다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d8eb940a7794fc46","term":"차다","zh":"冷，寒冷，凉，冰凉","audio":"/audio/d8eb940a7794fc46db6b.mp3","entryId":"37235","definition":"温度很低，不暖和。","pronunciation":["차다"]},{"id":"242a13186f116c2f","term":"메마르다","zh":"干燥","audio":"/audio/242a13186f116c2ffb71.mp3","entryId":"55809","definition":"空气中非常缺乏水分。","pronunciation":["메마르다"]},{"id":"9ec024bb0ceb6fd2","term":"바람","zh":"风","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3","entryId":"85627","definition":"气压的变化或者人类、机器等引起的空气的流动。","pronunciation":["바람"]},{"id":"1389fa35feb8849f","term":"불다","zh":"刮，吹","audio":"/audio/1389fa35feb8849f522f.mp3","entryId":"74179","definition":"风起而向某个方向移动。","pronunciation":["불ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/573d95dd8f725f904159.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55809-5-4-2","ko":"이제 겨울이 되려나 봐.","zh":"看来冬天就要来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"겨울이","meaning":"冬天，冬季","explanation":"겨울：冬天，冬季；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"겨울","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64367","senseId":"1","lemma":"겨울","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되려나","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；려나：表示对未来情况的疑问或推测。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看样子，看来","explanation":"보다：看样子，看来；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"当下的时期。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"ac9e69428d653c8c","term":"겨울","zh":"冬天，冬季","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3","entryId":"64367","definition":"四季中的一个，介于秋天和春天之间的寒冷的季节。","pronunciation":["겨울"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"到达某个时间、时期或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看样子，看来","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"由前面的话语所指的行动或状态来推算或表示即使不正确但知道。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/97a0d1a0868ab04384d9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.285,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=55809","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"5","sour